{"sections":[{"slug":"序列谱","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"序列谱"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">序列谱</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"序列谱"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">序列谱</span></strong> (sequential spectrum) $T_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">为一系列带基点空间</span> $\\{T_q\\}_{q\\geq 0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及映射</span> $S_q\\colon \\Sigma T_q \\to T_{q+1}$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $T_q\\to\\Omega T_{q+1}$. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $T_q\\to\\Omega T_{q+1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为弱同伦等价</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span> $\\Omega$-<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">序列谱</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\Sigma^{\\infty-n} X_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的余极限</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}